    <briefdescription>
<para>GGUF v3 provenance fields attached to a stored TT-core. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All string fields are UTF-8. The <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1storage_1_1_provenance_record_1a3e1733c549d6d40df79470b482bd3726" kindref="member">hmac_signature</ref></computeroutput> is a hex-encoded HMAC-SHA256 tag computed over the canonical fields (source.filename + page + line + doc_id + tenant_id + ingest_ts).</para>
<para>When <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1storage_1_1_provenance_record_1a3e1733c549d6d40df79470b482bd3726" kindref="member">hmac_signature</ref></computeroutput> is empty the record has not yet been signed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
